    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "pgsonify 把数据库健康状况变成大象叫声",
      "summary": "Dinesh Kumar 用 Go 写了 MIT 许可的 pgsonify，把数据库健康状况变成实时音效。它默认每 5 秒采样 pg_stat_activity、pg_locks、pg_stat_database 和检查点视图，不需要扩展或超级用户权限，据此算出 0 到 1 的压力分，驱动背景轰鸣的音高与节奏，分 CALM、ALERT、PANIC 三档。作者定位于开发、测试和教学，不替代生产监控。",
      "url": "https://cortexridge.com/blog/pgsonify-hear-your-postgresql-health/",
      "author": "Dinesh Kumar",
      "source": "Cortex Ridge 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-08-16",
      "image": "https://cortexridge.com/og/blog/pgsonify-hear-your-postgresql-health.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "监控",
        "工具"
      ],
